# OpenRouter's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-openrouter-setting-api-key = An OpenRouter API key (sk-or-v1-…) from https://openrouter.ai/settings/keys. A Management API key also works and adds the last 30 days of activity.
usage-openrouter-setting-management-api-key = Optional Management API key from https://openrouter.ai/settings/management-keys, used only for the last 30 days of account activity.
usage-openrouter-setting-base-url = Optional HTTPS API URL for a proxy. Defaults to https://openrouter.ai/api/v1.
usage-openrouter-setting-http-referer = Optional client URL sent as the HTTP-Referer header.
usage-openrouter-setting-x-title = Optional client title sent as the X-Title header. Defaults to Herdr.
